**Project Purpose** — PiliPlus is a Flutter-based third-party Bilibili client supporting video playback, comments, login/account features, downloads, live/dynamic content, settings, and multi-platform builds.

**Top-Level Structure** — Main areas are `lib/` for app code, `android/ios/windows/linux/macos/` for platform shells, `assets/` for images/resources, `test/` for tests, and root config files like `pubspec.yaml` and `analysis_options.yaml`.

**Key Modules Relevant To The Audit** — Likely central files include [lib/main.dart](C:/Users/Z14/Documents/Coding/Piliplus/lib/main.dart) for startup/service initialization, [lib/router/app_pages.dart](C:/Users/Z14/Documents/Coding/Piliplus/lib/router/app_pages.dart) for GetX routing, [lib/http/init.dart](C:/Users/Z14/Documents/Coding/Piliplus/lib/http/init.dart) for Dio/client/cookie/proxy setup, [lib/http/api.dart](C:/Users/Z14/Documents/Coding/Piliplus/lib/http/api.dart) for Bilibili endpoint constants, plus `lib/pages/`, `lib/services/`, `lib/utils/`, `lib/models/`, and `lib/plugin/pl_player/` for feature-specific behavior.

